  headline: Insane Adventurer "Forgets To Quicksave"
  article: 'An upsetting turn of events today, as well known non-violent hero <i>Paci
    Fistrun</i> is now  from authorities after committing what can only be described
    as <i>"a horrifying murder spree"</i>. Reports claimed he <i>''got bored and
    wanted to see what would happen.''</i>


    The hero released a statement this
    morning: <i>"I was just fooling around, I meant to reload after, but forgot to
    quicksave, I swear!


    Well, there goes this playthrough..."</i>'
